id: BUILD-040
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Avoid process.exit() in library/application code
category: build
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ bin/ cli/ scripts/
  content_contains: process.exit
patterns:
  - regex: process\.exit\(\s*[0-9]*\s*\)
    message: "process.exit() in application code — forcefully terminates the process, bypasses cleanup, breaks testing and composability"
fix: Throw an Error instead and let the caller decide how to handle it. Reserve process.exit() for CLI entry points only.
